  unitNumber: 7002
  description: No one knows the true origins of these Golems that are found wandering
    the ruins of Orebus. Giselle's analysis indicates that these particular tiny
    constructs harbor very potent and pure concentration of water elemental energy.
    They have been observed to channel mini water sprouts at ponds for no apparent
    reason.
